# The repo-root .gitignore excludes `data/` everywhere (it predates this
# Android module and was meant for Python data dumps). Re-include our
# Kotlin `data/` package explicitly so the build doesn't lose the
# model/network/preferences/repository sources.
!app/src/main/java/com/aci/hermes/data/
!app/src/main/java/com/aci/hermes/data/**
!app/src/test/java/com/aci/hermes/data/
!app/src/test/java/com/aci/hermes/data/**
!app/src/androidTest/java/com/aci/hermes/data/
!app/src/androidTest/java/com/aci/hermes/data/**

# Gradle
.gradle/
build/
**/build/
local.properties
captures/

# IntelliJ / Android Studio
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/

# Kotlin
.kotlin/

# Native binaries
*.so
*.dex
*.hprof

# Generated by Android tools
generated/
release/

# Secrets
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
key.properties
google-services.json
